					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-8448073#post-4050928</guid>
				<title>Re: Author Post</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-8448073/carroll-055:the-workshop#post-4050928</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 06 Nov 2018 01:36:13 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Uncle Nicolini</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3487700</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Hooray!<br /> I wanted to write a Chicago Spirit format for a while, and after working with <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1581620&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1541468173" alt="DarkStuff" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1581620)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" >DarkStuff</a></span> to make the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/wonder-world">Wonderful World</a> canon I also wanted to explore the history of Wondertainment.<br /> Put two and two together, and boom.</p> <p>I can't thank <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rockteethmotheyes" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4022320&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1541468173" alt="RockTeethMothEyes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4022320)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rockteethmotheyes" >RockTeethMothEyes</a></span> enough for helping shape this up.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-8448073#post-4050921</guid>
				<title>Author Post</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-8448073/carroll-055:the-workshop#post-4050921</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 06 Nov 2018 01:17:10 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>RockTeethMothEyes</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4022320</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Chicago Spirit is looking for new business grounds, and they found a Wonderous pair to <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">manipulate</span> cooperate with!</p> <p>Thank you to my collaborator <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1541485160" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" >Uncle Nicolini</a></span> for approaching me with this article and inviting me to be a part of it! This was a nice way of stepping out of impartial tone for a bit.</p> <p>Thank you to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3075960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1541485160" alt="stormbreath" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3075960)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" >stormbreath</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1581620&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1541485160" alt="DarkStuff" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1581620)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" >DarkStuff</a></span> for their critique! (Special thank you to DarkStuff for the creation of Wonder World!™. I love this canon so much.)</p> <p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3207203&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1541485160" alt="JackalRelated" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3207203)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" >JackalRelated</a></span> for the initial edit on the building photo and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drshine" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4378103&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1541485160" alt="DrShine" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4378103)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drshine" >DrShine</a></span> for the final edit!</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+Image&nbsp;Attribution</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-Hide&nbsp;Content</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Image 1 - Building: Taken by me, RockTeeth.<br /> Image 2 - Chester: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:African_American_scholars#/media/File:William_Hooper_Councill.jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:African_American_scholars#/media/File:William_Hooper_Councill.jpg</a><br /> Image 3 - Maria: <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/library_of_congress/40935481854/in/album-72157690775854080/">https://www.flickr.com/photos/library_of_congress/40935481854/in/album-72157690775854080/</a></p> </div> </div> </div> 
				 	]]>
